    },
    {
      "id": "P16",
      "hash": "3916e3d1844dabe8dd2394e8a92a4b29b55e4a73c09a6fc3e7431638821d33c4",
      "heading": "Battle of Sellasia",
      "excerpt": "In 224 BC, while Antigonus was liberating the occupied cities in the Peloponnese, Cleomenes was reinforcing his army. The winter of 223 BC s",
