      "id": "P17",
      "hash": "9ece3ffa6260567e2ccfba130b2b8f067012692be36d94c25cadb1a44d494869",
      "heading": "Social War",
      "excerpt": "In 221 BC, the Aetolians began pillaging the territory of Messenia. In 220 BC, the council of the Achaean League met in Aegium to discuss th",
