      "id": "P18",
      "hash": "5f7bbb8b23d005111e3de0361c2165da330c2ff6d7fc4d2f64affa0ff24496d0",
      "heading": "Death",
      "excerpt": "After the Social War, Philip caused a civil war in Messene, and possibly kept Aratus out of the matter deliberately. Unhappy, Aratus ordered",
